menu "SuperNova Phase 2"

    config SN_ENABLE_ESPNOW
        bool "Compile the ESP-NOW transport adapter"
        default n
        depends on ESP_WIFI_ENABLED
        help
            Compiles the single-hop ESP-NOW adapter in sn_transport. It remains
            uninitialized unless application code explicitly calls it. Radios are
            disabled by default and must never be started during QEMU evaluation.
            Multi-hop routing, peer authentication, retransmission, and partition
            recovery are deferred.

endmenu
